              "type": "text",
              "content": "times to place 4 new copies, resulting in a 3 by 3 grid of 9 copies exactly like the 9 coloured copies in Fig. 12.42. These 9 copies meet each other only at vertices and once again the blank spaces among them also form 4-gons congruent to SOME!"
            }
